    "video": {
      "name": "Keto Golden Chicken & Rice [Skillet Meal]",
      "description": "This chicken and cauliflower dish is a scrumptious and healthy meal that’s perfect for dinner on a busy weeknight or to whip up for a tasty lunch. All you need is a few common ingredients and a good skillet and you’re good to go.\n\nMaking this dish is dead simple. All you need to do is coat the chicken in the spices and then place it in your piping-hot skillet. Once browned, add your cauliflower rice and chopped zucchini and cook it through. And that’s it. Mission complete.\n\nServe the finished dish onto plates and top with some fresh cilantro. If you have any leftovers, this dish makes a great lunch the next day heated back up or you can even freeze a second portion to enjoy another night.\n\nThis dish contains lots of healthy lean protein from the chicken, healthy fats from the avocado oil, and a great assortment of vitamins and minerals from the cauliflower and zucchini. There’s also a pinch of turmeric, which is known to have anti-inflammatory and antioxidant qualities.\n\nIf you’d like to whip up a tasty and healthy keto-friendly dinner in under 20 minutes, give this dish a go. You and the family are going to love it!\n\nRead the full recipe with full nutrition breakdown and step-by-step pictures over at:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nIngredients:\n400 gram cauliflower, riced\n1 medium zucchini, diced\n1/4 cup avocado oil\n1 tablespoon turmeric powder\n2 teaspoon cumin\n1 teaspoon onion powder\n1/2 teaspoon garlic powder\n1/2 teaspoon black pepper\n500 gram ground chicken\n3 ounce fresh cilantro\n\nNutrition Summary: This makes a total of 4 servings of Keto Golden Chicken & Rice Skillet. Each serving comes out to be 350 calories, 24.9g fat, 5g net carbs, and 25.2g protein.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSee more keto recipes, knowledge and tips on the website to keep your weight loss going strong.\n\nEverything you need to know about the keto diet:\n\nGetting started? Everything you need is here:\n\nWe also make things easy with this 14 day diet plan:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nFollow Ruled.Me for more tasty food:",
